REM CONFIG.SYS excerpt for IBMRA1.SYS (IBM Rapid Access Keyboard I enabler)
REM Load it after the keyboard driver (KBD01.SYS or the ArcaOS equivalent).
REM Options: (none) quiet; /V verbose; /Q no messages at all; /W wait for a key;
REM          /AA beep when the driver is loaded. Options can be combined.
DEVICE=C:\OS2\BOOT\IBMRA1.SYS
REM DEVICE=C:\OS2\BOOT\IBMRA1.SYS /V
REM DEVICE=C:\OS2\BOOT\IBMRA1.SYS /V /W /AA
